{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t04.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t04.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t04_01",
      "hash64": "916BCBBC289694FB",
      "text": "这里是深钵镇。\\n是花儿与艺术的城镇！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t04_09",
      "hash64": "916BC3BC28968763",
      "text": "向日花怪那苦恼的表情！\\n作者是在什么样的心情下创作的呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t04_12",
      "hash64": "916F4EBC2899A96B",
      "text": "我和女友约在\\n奇怪的摆设前面碰面！\\r\\n但她一直都没来！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t04_26",
      "hash64": "9172D0BC289CBC28",
      "text": "我和男友约在\\n奇怪的摆设前面碰面，\\r\\n但这个镇子里奇怪的摆设也太多了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t04_31",
      "hash64": "91763BBC289FA7D0",
      "text": "深钵知名的迷宫运动场！\\n来挑战一下吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t04_36",
      "hash64": "917642BC289FB3B5",
      "text": "一到春天，\\n向日种子就会乘风飞来。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t04_58",
      "hash64": "917CD0BC28A510AD",
      "text": "哎呀～这个作品的理念\\n就是强调对比啊～\\r\\n外行人一定看不出来吧～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t04_64",
      "hash64": "918052BC28A8236A",
      "text": "我是来看这个著名作品的！\\n虽然看不出个所以然来，但真不错啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t04_65",
      "hash64": "918053BC28A8251D",
      "text": "又是一条死路……\\n唉，我迷路了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t04_69",
      "hash64": "918047BC28A810B9",
      "text": "你竟然能到这里来，\\n真厉害啊！\\c\\n因为谁都到不了这里，\\n所以我才把这里当秘密基地的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t04_74",
      "hash64": "9183D0BC28AB2F5B",
      "text": "如果累了，\\n就试着稍稍停下脚步……\\r\\n如此一来，应该也会有新发现吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t04_76",
      "hash64": "9183D2BC28AB32C1",
      "text": "我真不敢相信向日种子\\n一进化就会变成向日花怪。\\r\\n进化可真是太～神奇了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t04_105",
      "hash64": "B9D313B8FD20C76C",
      "text": "我的坐骑宝可梦很棒吧～！\\c\\n我正和这家伙\\n一起到各处旅行呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t04_115",
      "hash64": "B9CFA7B8FD1DDA11",
      "text": "这就是寇沙老师的作品吗！\\n但似乎风格有些不同……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t04_118",
      "hash64": "B9CFA2B8FD1DD192",
      "text": "高高的地方就是好～！\\c\\n听说镇外有个像高塔一样，\\n叫做瞭望台的地方！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
